[ASM] assembled: real hypotheses + injected derived facts |= false
  TRUE  ASM: a>=2, r=a^2(w-s), 1<=r<=a^2-1 |= false              unsat                         0.01s  want=unsat      OK
      via | nia-linearize: decided unsat
  FALSE cASM: window widened to 1 <= r <= a^2                    sat                           0.01s  want=sat        OK
      via | nia-linearize: decided sat
